---
// Closing statement on my marble picture with navy mountains rising on the left and gold veins
// (.bg-closing in global.css): one short heading and a few plain sentences. On wide screens the
// particle cloud stays beside the text while the section scrolls (a sticky box on the left) and forms
// an AI chip in navy dots ("ai" in shapes.ts).
---

<section id="closing" class="section-bg bg-closing relative py-28 sm:py-40" data-theme="ivory" data-shapes="ai@0.12">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:row-start-1" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="h-56 lg:sticky lg:top-[20vh] lg:h-[60vh]" data-cloud></div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6 lg:row-start-1">
      <div class="reveal shield">
        <h2 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl leading-[1.0]" data-split>Experience decides what to build.</h2>
        <p class="mt-8 text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-[50ch]">
          AI writes code fast, and I use it every day. It does not know your business, what breaks in production at night, or which shortcut costs you a year later.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-[50ch]">
          Someone who has shipped it before builds it in a fraction of the time, with fewer surprises, and leaves you a system you can still run in five years.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
